  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for MediatR — add retry, timeout, circuit-breaker, rate-limiting, hedging, and chaos engineering to any MediatR request handler with a single line of DI registration. Wraps MediatR IPipelineBehavior with a ResiliencePipeline so transient faults, timeouts and overload are handled automatically without touching handler code.",
